    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d886">

                <pb facs="0938" n="926" sameAs="frus:frus1941v01/pg926"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">361.1121 Roszkowski, Mieczyslaw/10:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Thurston</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1940-08-16">August 16,
                        1940</date>.<lb/>[Received August 17—1:34 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1030. Department’s 192, March 30th, and Embassy’s 586, May 27th.<anchor n="99"
                        xml:id="d886-f1"/> Embassy now informed Roszkowski arrested June 29th for
                    alleged illegal possession firearms and was to be tried July 22nd but trial
                    postponed. Inquiry in matter being addressed to Foreign Office.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Thurston</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
